WEBVTT

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.610
Shiragami...

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:10.530
Why?

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.400
Kuromine-kun...

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.850
Shiragami!

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:23.030
Why would you just go away like that?!

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:24.830
Stay calm, Kuromine Asahi.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:26.760
Class Rep...

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.920
Aizawa, I wasn't really told anything.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.420
Is it true that she was abducted?

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.050
Yes, by a huge bat like none I've ever seen.

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:38.000
A huge bat, huh?

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.890
That'd have to be someone 
from Youko's family, then.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:43.890
Please, just hurry.

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:45.520
I'm still a teacher, you know.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:47.520
I'm doing the speed limit already.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.400
Besides, I had to give up

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.360
my pre-meal beer,

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.630
my post-meal beer,

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:53.970
my pre-sleep beer,

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.270
my weekend beer,

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:57.360
and every other kind of beer

00:00:57.520 --> 00:00:59.740
to be able to afford this brand new car!

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:04.250
I think that sentence alone tells me
what your private life is like.

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:06.710
You're such a spinster.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:10.590
Buying a new car when you don't 
even have a man to sit beside you.

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:11.460
When did you...

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:13.160
Relax.

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:16.060
With my powers as a devil,

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:18.640
we can get there before the end of the night.

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:19.840
Really?

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:20.680
W-Wait!

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:22.810
Go to sleep, spinster.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:25.980
Sensei!

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:28.310
Hang on tight!

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:12.960
<b>Let's Go Home
Together!</b>

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:12.220
Let's Go Home Together!

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:17.400
Why should you apologize?

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:21.180
I'm just asking you a question.

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:24.890
Where is my brand new car?

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.610
K-Koumoto-sensei...

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:29.430
Um, it's right there.

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:32.040
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.640
That's just a lump of metal.

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:36.890
Listen, Akari.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:40.780
I kept my promise to Kuromine, 
that we'd get there tonight.

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:44.780
And a devil always has 
a price for any promise.

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:47.510
What about it?

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.550
My point is,

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:53.210
your new car is that price.

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:57.120
Damn you, you old hag!

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:58.880
I'll handle the spinster!

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:02.220
Kuromine Asahi. Shishido Shiho.

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.260
Are you two ready?

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:07.020
Wait, Class Rep, you're way too into this.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.350
No, I'm not.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:11.520
We're infiltrating a vampire's mansion.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.690
We must go prepared.

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:16.720
Kuromine Asahi.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:21.010
Before we begin the operation, there's 
something I must apologize to you for.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:23.700
My selfish behavior

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.220
has caused you great trouble yet again.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.120
I'm truly sorry.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:31.870
Wait, Class Rep...

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.800
As atonement, I request that

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:37.080
you allow me to do my best to 
help rescue Shiragami Youko.

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:40.210
Don't worry about it.

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:43.970
That whole thing did surprise me,

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:47.890
but it'd really help if you'd give us a hand.

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:51.270
R-Right.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.920
You two seem to be hitting it off.

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.480
W-We are not!

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:57.880
Ahem.

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:00.480
Kuromine and Shishido,

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:03.960
we will hereby commence 
Operation: Rescue Shiragami Youko.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.330
Yes, Captain.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.750
Looks like we can get in from here.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:14.880
Let's go.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.400
What is this place?

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:39.240
Be careful, you two.

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:42.140
What's that?

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:55.500
Who sneaks into my house unannounced?

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.660
He's huge!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.000
Wh-Who are you?

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:00.290
Oh, I forgot to tell you.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.400
This is Youko's dad.

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:04.260
What?!

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:07.790
<i>To think that such a massive 
creature existed on this planet!</i>

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.930
<i>He looks nothing like Shiragami.</i>

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:12.890
Who are these people, Shiho?

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:14.610
N-Nice to meet you.

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:16.900
I'm Shiragami-san's classmate.

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.270
My name is Kuromine Asahi.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.220
I'm here today to ask a favor of you.

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:23.640
U-Um...

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:27.240
Please give Shiragami back!

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:28.610
What?

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.370
What nonsense is this, boy?

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:34.940
What is your relationship with my daughter?

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:38.120
Dad?

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:40.620
There you are.

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.200
Sh-Shiragami!

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:43.670
Huh? Kuromine-kun?

00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:45.460
Why are you... And you guys, too?

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:46.920
Move, Youko.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.730
Stay out of this, moron.

00:06:48.730 --> 00:06:49.880
What?!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.300
What do you mean, moron?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.180
That's exactly what you are!

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:55.600
What the?

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.890
Looks like the garlic powder ball worked.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:03.040
Now! Get Shiragami Youko!

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:04.230
Right!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.690
Let's run, Shiragami!

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.570
Wh-What's going on, Kuromine-kun?

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:12.110
We're here to take you back.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:14.060
Yeah, but why?

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:15.620
It's about your secret.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.880
W-Wait a second.

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:19.620
I think you misunderstood something.

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:23.630
I heard my mom was in bed sick,

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:26.380
so I just came home to take care of her.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:29.380
What? You were taking care of...

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:31.640
...your sick mom?

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:36.880
Then everything we just did...

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:39.630
...was a huge misunderstanding.

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:41.520
So it was, huh?

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:45.590
Who wouldn't misunderstand that?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:51.280
After you say something suggestive like 
"come to the rooftop after school"...

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.680
Uh... Sorry about that.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:57.660
I was just going to tell you that 
I was going home for a bit.

00:07:57.940 --> 00:07:59.380
O-Oh.

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:03.500
I totally thought your dad had
found out about your secret.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.000
Boy...

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:07.160
What did you just say?

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.940
You know

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.430
Youko's secret, do you?

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:17.010
No, no, I don't!

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:18.850
You must have misheard me!

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:21.360
Then what was that garlic for?

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:26.980
I-I need it for dinner tonight.

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:29.520
Really?

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:30.940
R-Re—

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:32.700
Really.

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:35.280
Your face says you're lying!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:38.140
Youko, you promised.

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:41.670
Since your secret is out, your high school life

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:43.460
is now over!

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:46.080
Now's our chance!

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.500
Take this and run!

00:08:48.310 --> 00:08:48.880
Got it!

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:50.420
Let's go, Shiragami.

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:51.140
Right.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.880
You little...

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:52.880
Sir!

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.680
With all due respect, please hear me out.

00:08:56.480 --> 00:09:00.350
Kuromine Asahi is not the 
kind of man that you—

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.320
He left already.

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:03.980
What?!

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:08.270
You're not getting away!

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:09.680
Something...

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:11.280
Isn't there something in here?

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:12.570
Here we go!

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.070
Not a cross!

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:15.990
What?

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:17.830
Are you trying to pick a fight?

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:19.490
Now he's really mad!

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:22.370
Don't we have anything else?

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:23.700
Oh! This'll...

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.670
No way, Class Rep!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:31.380
It worked?!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.300
Kuromine-kun, over here.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:40.970
Ow...

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.520
Wh-Where are we?

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.180
This is my room.

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:47.100
Your room?

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:48.330
Yeah.

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:52.620
As a vampire, my dad isn't allowed 
into my room without my permission.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:53.820
We're safe now.

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.670
That's how it works?

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.320
Th-That aside...

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.350
Sorry, Shiragami.

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:02.830
K-Kuromine-kun?

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:05.960
It's my fault your dad knows 
that your secret got out.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:10.330
Listen... Like I said before,

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:15.260
it's really not your fault that my secret got out.

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.580
First of all,

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:20.210
it's my fault that I couldn't 
keep my promise with my dad.

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:24.780
So you don't need to try so hard 
to run with me and stuff.

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.730
B-But, Shiragami...

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:30.170
I want to apologize, too.

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:34.820
To be honest, there was 
something else that I wanted

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:36.740
to tell you on the rooftop.

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:39.360
I don't really get it myself,

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.240
but lately, for some reason, 
whenever I see you,

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:45.300
I feel awkward and end up avoiding you...

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.830
And I really feel bad about it.

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.370
Sorry, Kuromine-kun.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.890
You don't have to apologize.

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:54.070
O-Oh, yeah...

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:56.760
There's something I've been 
meaning to tell you, too.

00:10:57.570 --> 00:10:59.220
About the day of the festival...

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:08.100
I was just helping the class rep when she fell.

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.440
What happened at school 
was just an accident, too.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:13.860
So it's nothing like what you're thinking!

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:16.280
So I don't want you to get the wrong idea...

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:19.960
What am I even saying, at a time like this?

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:23.230
That's not what I meant... I, um...

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:24.690
Anyway, I'm sorry!

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:27.960
You're always like that, you know?

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:31.920
You're really an open book.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:33.640
Shiragami...

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.000
Then—

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.470
You're in here, aren't you, Youko?

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:41.490
Dad?!

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:42.760
He found us!

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:43.970
Open up, brat!

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:47.970
<b>Let's give this an                                 I'm getting nervous.                          Looks like we're up!
awesome finish!</b>

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:53.690
You're in here, aren't you, Youko?

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:55.710
Wait, Dad, what are you doing?

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:57.390
I thought he couldn't come in here.

00:11:57.390 --> 00:11:58.300
That voice!

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.190
Is that the boy from earlier?

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:04.170
You have gall, going into 
my daughter's room, boy!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.060
You!

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:08.180
What are you planning to do to Youko?

00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:09.680
I'm not doing anything!

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:11.460
Get out here right now!

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.920
I-I really can't do that!

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:17.290
Then I'll just drag you out!

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:19.760
Don't do anything crazy, Dad!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:25.270
I'll rip this barrier apart!

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:26.490
Genjirou-kun.

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:29.650
What are you doing over here?

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.600
T-Touko-san!

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:34.720
Mom?

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.920
I brought her here.

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:40.530
You chased Youko's classmate around,

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.700
and ended up demolishing the house.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.130
N-No!

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:47.200
He said he knows Youko's secret!

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:48.810
Really?

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:53.330
Then it looks like we'll 
need to have a little talk.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.830
Wait! What are you gonna do with those?!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.670
A-All right, Touko-san!

00:12:57.890 --> 00:13:00.670
I get it, so please, anything but that!

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:02.670
Not a stake to my heart!

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:05.510
No!

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:09.420
Okay, you two, have fun.

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:11.080
Huh?

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:13.360
I thought your mom was sick.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:15.270
Well, actually,

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:18.860
it's true that Mom got sick and had a fever,

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.690
<b>Combustibles
out on Monday
and Friday</b>

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.440
but Dad was just overreacting.

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:23.440
Youko?

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:24.780
Come home immediately!

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:27.260
It really wasn't that big a deal.

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:29.120
Then what was that bat?

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.990
That was my dad coming 
to pick me up in a panic.

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:34.130
He gets so worked up over nothing.

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:38.800
M-My impression of your dad just did a 180.

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:41.890
There.

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:44.100
We'll be safe for a while now.

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:46.710
But how long do we have to stay in here?

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:48.600
Well...

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:52.140
I'm sure Dad will give up 
and go to sleep by morning.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.800
B-By morning?!

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:55.560
That's...

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:01.670
<i>N-No way...</i>

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:04.940
<i>Just the two of us in Shiragami's 
room until morning?</i>

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.410
Don't look around so much!

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:12.200
Look out!

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:20.380
Are you two all... right?!

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:23.350
A-Aizawa-san...

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:24.960
C-Class Rep...

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:33.140
What are you doing, Eromine Asahi?!

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:34.810
Don't evade me!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:36.850
Whoa! Not the hammer!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.350
Not a hammer! 
It's a Memory Erasure Device!

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:41.230
That's it!

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.480
That's it, Class Rep!

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:46.490
Damn it.

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:48.990
Why am I the one that gets yelled at?

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:53.740
I'm coming in, Dad.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:58.000
Kuromine-kun wants to talk to you.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.710
Boy! What do you want?

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:01.940
Well...

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.710
I'm here to ask a favor of you, Father.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.900
"Father," you say?!

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:09.180
You have no right to call me that!

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:09.860
Wait...

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:13.260
Y-You're not going to ask me for 
Youko's hand in marriage, are you?!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:14.260
What?!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:15.720
O-Of course not!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:16.890
We're not even going out!

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.680
Going out?!

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:21.800
You're going to get it now, boy.

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:23.810
I-I said we're not!

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:26.260
Dad, you don't even need to worry about that!

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:29.320
I'm not worried about you!

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.080
Oh, yeah, Class Rep.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:33.920
Do you have that hammer?

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:34.820
Yeah...

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:36.280
Father,

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:39.580
a blow to the head from this
hammer can erase memories.

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:40.750
Huh?

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:43.460
What's the idea, Kuromine Asahi?

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:46.210
I can't let an Earthling use that!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.420
What are <i>you</i> doing, Class Rep?!

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:52.140
What the heck is this?!

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:53.010
Shoot!

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:56.320
I-It's not... It's just... not!

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:58.790
Oh, yeah! Dad, you're a vampire anyway!

00:15:58.790 --> 00:15:59.960
O-Oh, right.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:01.930
It's okay if he knows she's an alien.

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:03.770
Just give that back.

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:08.650
Okay, let's say you can really erase 
memories with that hammer.

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.540
So what of it?

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:12.960
I want you to promise.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.770
Promise, you say?

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:15.530
Yes.

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:19.950
Please promise that if my memories 
of Shiragami's secret are erased,

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:23.250
Shiragami doesn't have to quit school.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:27.130
Shiragami has a lot of friends.

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:29.450
Erase my memories,

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:33.050
and Shiragami can go back to the
fun school life she had before.

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:35.300
Please, Father.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:36.740
I'm...

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:39.830
Shiragami's friend, too.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:42.690
Even if I lose my memories,

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.750
I want...

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:48.020
to always protect Youko-san!

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:00.370
Very well, boy.

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:01.530
Then...

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:04.680
But that's not good enough for me.

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:09.210
Erase <i>all</i> of your memories about Youko.

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:13.170
If you're prepared to do that, 
I'll agree to your promise.

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.120
Dad, what are you—

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.180
If I do...

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:19.840
Shiragami can go back to school, right?

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:24.490
Shiragami Genjirou always keeps his word.

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:28.150
Class Rep, would you please?

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:34.080
W-Well, it's possible if I hit you hard enough...

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:37.140
Please, as hard as you can.

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:40.090
Are you sure?

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:41.650
Yeah.

00:17:57.860 --> 00:17:58.710
I can't.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:03.600
I can't do it.

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:09.400
Thanks, Class Rep.

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:12.380
I'll do the rest.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.630
No!

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:33.380
Shiragami?

00:18:33.620 --> 00:18:35.170
Kuromine-kun, you idiot!

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:37.280
I told you!

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:41.700
You don't need to suffer to protect my secret.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:45.220
I don't want you to go so far 
just to protect my secret.

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:47.740
Aizawa-san, Akemi-san,

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:49.410
Oka-kun and the other guys,

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:51.620
and Shiho, who just transferred...

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:55.840
It's because of you that I got 
to be friends with all of them.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:19:00.640
Even if you forgot about me 
just to keep my secret,

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:02.490
I'd still have my memories.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:06.820
How could school be any fun for me then?

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:09.000
Because, Asahi-kun,

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:11.750
you're my precious...

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:13.760
My precious...

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:20.970
What?!

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:22.400
Dad?

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:24.220
What's wrong?

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:25.870
What just...

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:30.310
I-It's...

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:31.900
I-It can't be!

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.230
The Memory Erasure Device just happened to

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:38.690
nail your dad and erase his memories?!

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:40.760
Wh-What?!

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:44.320
I'm sorry.

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:47.000
This is all I could make.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.310
Not at all. Thank you very much.

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:50.830
Time to eat.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.840
Want some rice balls, Aizawa-san?

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:58.250
Thank you.

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:02.560
Sorry about everything.

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:04.500
About what?

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.510
Oh, it's not about you.

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:10.030
But to think you had the same feelings I did.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:12.800
What you said earlier.

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.800
I like being with you guys...

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:17.780
with everyone, too.

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:20.510
You do too, huh?

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:21.820
That makes me happy.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:24.400
<i>And...</i>

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:28.260
<i>that's probably not the only thing 
we feel the same way about.</i>

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:31.240
Shiragami Youko...

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:36.230
If you should come to realize 
something about yourself one day,

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:39.430
you don't need to worry about me.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:41.840
Something about myself?

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.280
What are you talking about, Aizawa-san?

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.200
Never mind.

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:50.810
I'm truly sorry.

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:54.760
My students seem to have 
caused you a lot of trouble.

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:57.400
No, no, don't worry about it.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:00.440
Sensei, what happened to that car?

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:03.480
She didn't fix it with her devil powers, did she?

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:06.660
No, I made her pay for it in full.

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:08.620
We'll be going now.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:10.590
Thank you for everything.

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:12.640
Please come visit us again, all of you.

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:13.430
Okay.

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:14.410
See you, Mom.

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:18.420
Are you okay with this, dear?

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.710
Youko's leaving.

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:25.280
I don't care about that stupid brat!

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:28.550
Who even told her to come 
home in the first place?

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:30.670
Forget it.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:38.320
I wonder if your dad really lost his memories.

00:21:38.320 --> 00:21:41.410
I think he'll be fine, 
given how he was acting just now.

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:45.240
H-Huh? Is your dad...

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:47.110
Dad?

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:49.240
He didn't get his memories back, did he?

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.690
Maybe he's trying to catch up to the car.

00:21:51.690 --> 00:21:52.870
Surely not.

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:55.370
Wait, is he...

00:21:55.600 --> 00:21:58.370
waving at you, Shiragami?

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:02.000
J-Jeez.

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:03.980
He's so...

00:22:05.730 --> 00:22:07.010
Dad!

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:09.530
U-Um...

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:11.930
See you soon!

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:25.500
Your dad's a good person.

00:22:26.220 --> 00:22:27.010
Yeah.

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:29.830
Hey, Shiragami.

00:22:31.250 --> 00:22:35.360
When you called me by my name yesterday...

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:37.870
What were you about to say?

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:40.960
Because, Asahi-kun,

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:42.960
you're my precious...

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:45.840
Nothing, Kuromine-kun.

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:51.550
Sorry, Shiragami.

00:22:52.160 --> 00:22:54.000
I understand now.

00:22:55.450 --> 00:22:58.280
I'll never say I'm going to 
erase my memories again,

00:22:58.850 --> 00:23:02.230
and I'll always keep your secret, 
no matter what happens.

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:06.320
Okay.
